{"speciesId":209,"names":{"fr":"Snubbull","es":"Snubbull","en":"Snubbull","ja":"ブルー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its af­ fectionate ways."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"In truth, it is a cowardly POKéMON. It growls eagerly in order to hide its fear from its opponent."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, SNUBBULL sends smaller POKéMON scurrying away in terror. However, this POKéMON seems a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, SNUBBULL sends smaller POKéMON scurrying away in terror. However, this POKéMON seems a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, it sends smaller POKéMON scurrying in terror. The SNUBBULL does seem a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son visage horrible fait fuir les petits Pokémon. Par contre, les femmes le trouvent mignon."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son visage horrible fait fuir les petits Pokémon. Par contre, les femmes le trouvent mignon."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est d’une nature joviale. De nombreuses femmes l’apprécient pour sa gentillesse."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Muy travieso por naturaleza, a muchas mujeres les gusta jugar con él porque es muy cariñoso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"活発で 遊び好きな 性格。 懐いてくれるので 一緒に 遊びたがる 女性も 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son visage horrible fait fuir les petits Pokémon. Par contre, les femmes le trouvent mignon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Los Pokémon pequeños huyen al ver su cara agresiva. No obstante, para muchas féminas es mono."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"小さな ポケモンが 逃げ出すほどの 怖い顔が 逆に かわいいと 女性に 人気の ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Snubbull terrorise les Pokémon plus petits que lui en montrant les dents et en faisant une grimace. Cependant, ce Pokémon est toujours un peu triste de voir ses ennemis prendre la fuite."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Al tener los colmillos por fuera, Snubbull da miedo y espanta a los Pokémon pequeños, que huyen aterrados. Parece que a él le da un poco de pena que salgan huyendo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, Snubbull sends smaller Pokémon scurrying away in terror. However, this Pokémon seems a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"キバを むき出して 怖い 顔を すれば 小さな ポケモンなら おびえて 逃げ出す。 逃げられた ブルーは ちょっと 寂しそう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Snubbull terrorise les Pokémon plus petits que lui en montrant les dents et en faisant une grimace. Cependant, ce Pokémon est toujours un peu triste de voir ses ennemis prendre la fuite."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Al tener los colmillos por fuera, Snubbull da miedo y espanta a los Pokémon pequeños, que huyen aterrados. Parece que a él le da un poco de pena que salgan huyendo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, Snubbull sends smaller Pokémon scurrying away in terror. However, this Pokémon seems a little sad at making its foes flee."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"キバを むき出して 怖い 顔を すれば 小さな ポケモンなら おびえて 逃げ出す。 逃げられた ブルーは ちょっと 寂しそう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Malgré sa mine renfrognée, il est en réalité plutôt craintif. Son visage faussement intimidant fait craquer les gens."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Su rostro da un poco de miedo, pero en realidad es bastante cobardica. A la gente suele hacerle gracia su cara de malas pulgas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Despite its intimidating face, it’s quite cowardly. Its desperate attempts to appear threatening make it popular with people."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"顔は 厳ついが 実は 結構 臆病。 必死に いかくする 表情が 女性に 人気。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Lorsqu’il n’aboie pas pour effrayer ses adversaires, ce Pokémon aime se la couler douce et dort 12 h par jour."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Sus ladridos inquietan a sus adversarios. Normalmente tiene una personalidad afable y se pasa la mitad del día durmiendo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its growls make its opponents uneasy. This laid-back Pokémon tends to sleep half the day."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"唸り声は 相手を 不安に させる。 普段は のんびり屋で １日の 半分は 寝ているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il s’attache très facilement et aime être cajolé. Une telle sensibilité cachée derrière une mine renfrognée fait fondre beaucoup de jeunes gens."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Le gusta que le hagan mimos y coge confianza con facilidad. A la gente le fascina el contraste entre su aspecto fiero y carácter dulce."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It grows close to others easily and is also easily spoiled. The disparity between its face and its actions makes many young people wild about it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"よく 懐いて よく 甘える。 その 仕草と 顔の ギャップで 若い 女性は メロメロらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Malgré les apparences, c’est un grand timide qui fait souvent l’objet de railleries quand il se trouve au milieu d’un groupe de Pokémon Chiot."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A pesar de su aspecto, es muy tímido y afable. A menudo es objeto de burla cuando se junta con Pokémon Perrito."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"In contrast to its appearance, it’s quite timid. When playing with other puppy Pokémon, it sometimes gets bullied."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"見た目と 違って 臆病なので 他の こいぬポケモンと 一緒に すると いじめられることも ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":209,"moves":[{"name":"me